I got a flat on my final run! I was on a heater and 30 seconds into my run I got a front flat which is why I had a huge crash coming into the final stretch. It's a sad ending for me but I'm glad to be walking away with no serious injuries. Thank you so much to everyone involved and Red Bull for putting on these crazy events. See you next year Hardline.


